WEBVTT

00:01:47.450 --> 00:01:48.730
High school.

00:01:50.890 --> 00:01:52.500
Those were the days.

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:02.610
Third ring.

00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:07.660
She's so cool.

00:02:07.730 --> 00:02:10.670
Yagami's good at everything.

00:02:10.740 --> 00:02:11.960
All she has left to conquer...

00:02:12.050 --> 00:02:13.480
is love.

00:02:14.170 --> 00:02:15.760
I wanna fall in love.

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:39.130
Bull's eye!

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:54.770
So, in a nutshell, Kokoro
is about a man

00:02:54.860 --> 00:02:57.920
who was a step ahead of his friend, "K"
in proposing to the woman they both loved,

00:02:57.980 --> 00:03:01.850
causing "K" to commit suicide.

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:04.510
Any questions thus far?

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:05.730
I do!

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:10.420
Y-Yes, Yagami?

00:03:12.860 --> 00:03:15.830
Let's say you're
the main character.

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:19.580
And let's say that the widow
at the boarding house

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:24.380
is a beautiful
young woman in her 20's.

00:03:24.450 --> 00:03:28.170
Could a love relationship blossom
between these characters?

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:33.350
I don't quite understand
your question.

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:36.800
I'm asking you
if you like widows.

00:03:39.730 --> 00:03:42.740
W-What does that have
anything to do with--?

00:03:42.830 --> 00:03:44.330
You know what I mean!

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:48.180
I want to know
how you feel, Mr. Godai.

00:03:56.740 --> 00:03:57.240
TEACHERS' OFFICE
What was that?

00:03:57.240 --> 00:03:59.520
TEACHERS' OFFICE

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:05.240
You mustn't let students
take control of the classroom.

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:06.550
I'm sorry.

00:04:06.790 --> 00:04:10.770
It seems Yagami has taken
quite a liking to you.

00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:11.700
N-No!

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:16.190
These girls may look mature,
but they're still children.

00:04:16.540 --> 00:04:17.860
Oh, thank you.

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:23.860
Under no circumstances should you
succumb to your carnal desires.

00:04:23.940 --> 00:04:25.340
Is that clear?

00:04:26.050 --> 00:04:28.340
Please! I wouldn't
if they begged me.

00:04:28.610 --> 00:04:30.300
--What?
--I mean...

00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:31.980
Yes, of course!

00:04:42.460 --> 00:04:44.310
What are you going to do?

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:47.610
Mr. Godai will be
gone in another week.

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:51.660
Don't worry. After all,
I'm the class president.

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:55.490
I can make an excuse to be
alone with him anytime I want.

00:04:58.570 --> 00:05:00.430
--See ya!
--Bye!

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:07.060
I think the current system
is unfair.

00:05:07.590 --> 00:05:09.710
I see your point.

00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:13.740
So I have an idea.
Take a look at this.

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:16.550
Well, Class President
see you later.

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:18.420
--Sure.
--Bye!

00:05:18.490 --> 00:05:19.860
Good luck! See ya!

00:05:20.730 --> 00:05:22.050
Bye.

00:05:29.130 --> 00:05:30.920
--Mr. Godai.
--Yes?

00:05:31.280 --> 00:05:32.820
This is my idea.

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:36.340
I think there should be
eight clean-up groups.

00:05:36.420 --> 00:05:40.150
And each group should
have an appointed leader.

00:05:40.220 --> 00:05:41.870
What do you think?

00:05:58.430 --> 00:06:02.230
An all-girls school
sure quiets down fast.

00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:03.990
Is this normal?

00:06:05.370 --> 00:06:06.340
Mr. Godai.

00:06:06.410 --> 00:06:07.490
Y-Yes?

00:06:11.240 --> 00:06:12.270
Mr. Godai--

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:22.610
Are you still here?

00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:27.670
What were you doing?

00:06:27.770 --> 00:06:28.860
Uh--

00:06:29.170 --> 00:06:31.460
We were discussing a new
proposal for clean-up time.

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:33.100
It's my job as
the class president.

00:06:33.170 --> 00:06:35.620
I see. Please go home soon.

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:37.860
Yes. We just finished.

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:43.610
Remember... Don't you dare
get yourself in trouble.

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:45.230
I'm aware of that.

00:06:47.350 --> 00:06:48.670
Mr. Godai!

00:06:50.880 --> 00:06:53.110
You don't have to
run from me!

00:06:53.750 --> 00:06:55.300
W-What do you want from me?!

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:57.250
Why are you so angry?

00:06:57.800 --> 00:06:59.180
I'm not angry.

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:01.740
Yes, you are.

00:07:11.370 --> 00:07:12.730
What do you want?

00:07:15.850 --> 00:07:17.340
Here. This.

00:07:17.650 --> 00:07:20.800
I made notes about each
group's responsibilities.

00:07:20.880 --> 00:07:22.310
I'd like you to take a look.

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:24.310
See you tomorrow.

00:07:26.860 --> 00:07:28.020
Bye!

00:07:41.670 --> 00:07:42.560
Godai.

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:47.130
Hi Kozue.

00:07:47.870 --> 00:07:50.490
Are you on your way home
from student teaching?

00:07:52.020 --> 00:07:54.130
Yeah. How've you been?

00:07:54.220 --> 00:07:55.730
Good.

00:08:03.190 --> 00:08:05.680
Aren't they going
ga-ga over you?

00:08:05.770 --> 00:08:06.460
Huh?

00:08:06.990 --> 00:08:08.050
Your students.

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:10.800
No way. They pick on me.

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:12.690
You never know.

00:08:12.770 --> 00:08:14.100
They may pretend to be
kidding around

00:08:14.170 --> 00:08:16.990
because they
have a crush on you.

00:08:17.280 --> 00:08:19.060
What about you, Kozue?

00:08:19.670 --> 00:08:22.130
Did you ever have a crush
on a student teacher?

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:27.980
I did, but I forgot
about him right away.

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:30.700
Two weeks are over
so quick, you know.

00:08:31.020 --> 00:08:33.940
Yeah. It's real quick.

00:08:35.590 --> 00:08:36.950
Of course you'd forget.

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:45.550
You're back.

00:08:46.010 --> 00:08:47.300
Hi.

00:08:47.740 --> 00:08:49.260
You're home late today.

00:08:49.330 --> 00:08:50.500
Uh-huh.

00:08:56.070 --> 00:08:57.800
Well, good night.

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:00.600
Good night.

00:09:01.990 --> 00:09:03.470
Oh, by the way--

00:09:03.550 --> 00:09:04.420
Huh?

00:09:04.950 --> 00:09:08.350
So how are things going?
Yagami...was it?

00:09:09.720 --> 00:09:11.490
W-Why do you ask that?

00:09:11.770 --> 00:09:12.720
Oh, I just wondered.

00:09:12.870 --> 00:09:16.630
Girls that age are
fearless, you know.

00:09:16.690 --> 00:09:19.050
I was just curious.

00:09:19.540 --> 00:09:22.090
Don't be ridiculous!
She's a child!

00:09:23.070 --> 00:09:26.880
I'm only interested
in older women.

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:33.780
I see. I'm sorry I asked.

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:35.920
As long as you understand.

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:09.810
I LOVE YOU.
W-What is this??

00:10:09.810 --> 00:10:15.700
I LOVE YOU.

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:19.620
How dare she pick on an adult!

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:22.800
She must think
I wouldn't get angry!

00:10:24.460 --> 00:10:27.420
Ooh. A confession of love?

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:30.930
It's too late to hide it now.

00:10:31.600 --> 00:10:33.660
C'mon! C'mon!

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:35.830
It's none of your business, Yotsuya!

00:10:36.920 --> 00:10:39.430
What's all the commotion?

00:10:39.520 --> 00:10:42.300
Godai's exchanging love diaries.

00:10:42.790 --> 00:10:44.250
Huh? With whom?

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:46.570
A high-school girl.

00:10:49.350 --> 00:10:51.790
--Wow!
--That's not true!!

00:10:52.030 --> 00:10:53.290
Lemme see! Lemme see!

00:10:53.370 --> 00:10:55.320
--NO!
--C'mon! Just a peek!

00:10:55.400 --> 00:10:57.420
--I said NO!
--C'mon!

00:11:00.140 --> 00:11:01.590
NO!!!

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:32.800
Good morning, Soichiro.

00:11:35.010 --> 00:11:36.630
What a nice day.

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:42.630
Good morning!

00:11:42.940 --> 00:11:43.880
Godai!

00:11:44.920 --> 00:11:47.670
I'm sorry about
what I said last night.

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:50.550
It was none of my business.

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:52.280
It's all right.

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:55.050
I'm drawing the line today.

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:57.180
--See you.
--Have a nice...

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:04.810
Oh, yes I need to
feed you breakfast.

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:17.740
G-Good morning.

00:12:18.070 --> 00:12:19.050
Can I help you?

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:21.910
Hmm... I wonder what this is?

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:31.180
Perhaps Godai forgot it.

00:12:31.260 --> 00:12:33.250
I wonder what it's for?

00:12:35.090 --> 00:12:36.920
Do you think it's important?

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:42.320
Gee... Godai's pretty
forgetful sometimes.

00:12:57.120 --> 00:13:00.440
...So please observe
these school rules.

00:13:00.680 --> 00:13:06.080
Also, this afternoon's sewing class
has been moved to Classroom #3.

00:13:06.170 --> 00:13:08.820
And those of you who haven't
brought in your PTA dues,

00:13:08.900 --> 00:13:11.450
please bring it by tomorrow.

00:13:13.110 --> 00:13:16.400
I have to get her alone and
tell it to her straight.

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:19.000
Godai... Godai?

00:13:19.100 --> 00:13:20.380
Y-Yes!

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:23.900
Mr. Godai, I said
"do you have anything to add"?

00:13:23.990 --> 00:13:25.190
N-No.

00:13:36.180 --> 00:13:38.860
Wow. Is that right?

00:13:39.270 --> 00:13:41.680
Godai's exchanging
love diaries?

00:13:41.740 --> 00:13:43.600
You smell trouble, or what?

00:13:43.690 --> 00:13:45.400
Yes.

00:13:46.690 --> 00:13:50.850
Oh, c'mon. Like you're
really troubled.

00:13:51.350 --> 00:13:52.790
You're right.

00:14:07.870 --> 00:14:09.710
I'll give you a ride...to school.

00:14:09.810 --> 00:14:11.200
To school?

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:15.000
Don't you have to take
that notebook to Godai?

00:14:16.320 --> 00:14:17.300
Mrs. Ichinose!

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:22.480
I'm sure he's in
a real bind by now.

00:14:22.830 --> 00:14:26.320
I don't know. I don't think
it's that important.

00:14:26.390 --> 00:14:29.250
Besides, I left it
at Maison Ikkoku.

00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:31.290
It's all right. Please.

00:14:31.360 --> 00:14:33.960
If we don't hurry,
school will be out.

00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:37.330
I'll hitch a ride
to Maison Ikkoku, then.

00:14:37.630 --> 00:14:39.720
C'mon, Manager. Get in.

00:14:43.550 --> 00:14:45.450
Thank you for waiting.

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:48.840
--I'm off.
--See you.

00:14:54.650 --> 00:14:57.270
This will make Godai happy.

00:15:03.390 --> 00:15:05.830
Oh, well. It'll be nice
to see my school again.

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:21.600
Thank you, Mitaka.

00:15:24.720 --> 00:15:26.610
Please give my regards to Godai.

00:15:26.920 --> 00:15:28.850
Y-Yes.

00:15:29.460 --> 00:15:30.220
Bye!

00:15:47.600 --> 00:15:50.100
Wow. It's been ages.

00:16:02.750 --> 00:16:03.850
Huh?

00:16:06.720 --> 00:16:07.590
How pretty.

00:16:10.260 --> 00:16:11.240
What's up?

00:16:11.340 --> 00:16:12.490
Look!

00:16:12.730 --> 00:16:15.470
It's her from Mr. Godai's!

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:18.840
The widow is here?

00:16:19.230 --> 00:16:21.600
She must have come
to see Mr. Godai.

00:16:21.680 --> 00:16:22.940
How bold.

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:24.620
The nerve!

00:16:34.690 --> 00:16:36.950
Oh? She's not here.

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:39.350
Maybe she went home.

00:16:39.620 --> 00:16:41.610
Have you seen Yagami?

00:16:41.830 --> 00:16:42.650
No.

00:16:42.760 --> 00:16:43.700
Oh.

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:52.100
Nothing's changed.

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:56.650
Hello.

00:16:57.470 --> 00:16:58.400
Oh.

00:17:04.490 --> 00:17:05.540
Hello.

00:17:06.110 --> 00:17:09.440
What brings you to our school?

00:17:09.850 --> 00:17:12.910
I brought something Godai
forgot at home.

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:14.090
Something he forgot?

00:17:14.270 --> 00:17:15.320
Uh-huh.

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:21.640
Th-That's mine!

00:17:22.310 --> 00:17:25.830
Oh. Then my job is done.

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:26.930
Good bye.

00:17:27.550 --> 00:17:28.510
Wait.

00:17:29.670 --> 00:17:34.540
Do you-- How do you
feel about Mr. Godai?

00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:40.580
Oh.

00:17:47.890 --> 00:17:49.520
There you go.

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:51.520
Bye.

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:01.990
Fine.

00:18:02.670 --> 00:18:05.460
Go ahead and strut your
mature woman stuff.

00:18:05.670 --> 00:18:08.770
I'll get him with
my youthful charm!

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:19.100
I can't seem to get her alone.

00:18:19.650 --> 00:18:21.880
Mr. Godai!

00:18:22.190 --> 00:18:24.710
Mr. Godai! Hurry!

00:18:24.800 --> 00:18:25.760
W-What's the matter?

00:18:25.840 --> 00:18:27.560
--Come! Please!
--Hurry!

00:18:31.980 --> 00:18:32.900
What's wrong?

00:18:32.980 --> 00:18:35.740
Just come! Hurry!

00:18:35.940 --> 00:18:39.430
GYM EQUIPMENT STORAGE ROOM

00:18:39.640 --> 00:18:41.360
You heard weird noises inside?

00:18:41.490 --> 00:18:42.410
Yes.

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:49.260
I don't see anything out of--

00:18:50.800 --> 00:18:52.620
What do you think you're--?!

00:18:53.260 --> 00:18:54.780
Open the door!

00:18:54.890 --> 00:18:56.490
--Hey!
--Mr. Godai.

00:19:06.740 --> 00:19:09.600
Y-Yagami! W-What are you doing?!

00:19:09.670 --> 00:19:12.540
Quiet! If you make too
much noise, I'll scream.

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:15.510
I'm serious.

00:19:19.320 --> 00:19:21.980
I'm sorry to come unannounced.

00:19:22.990 --> 00:19:25.410
How many years has it been?

00:19:26.030 --> 00:19:28.920
You haven't changed
at all, Ms. Kamiogi.

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:36.290
Oh, please. You, too, Ms. Chigusa--
I mean, Mrs. Otonashi.

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:41.560
And Godai is your tenant?
What a small world.

00:19:42.400 --> 00:19:44.240
How is he doing as a teacher?

00:19:45.520 --> 00:19:50.170
Some of the girls seem to have
taken a great liking to him.

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:54.010
S-Stop, Yagami! Cut it out!

00:19:54.150 --> 00:19:56.710
If someone sees us like this
we'll both be in big trouble!

00:19:56.790 --> 00:19:59.110
You're the one who'll
be in big trouble.

00:19:59.190 --> 00:20:02.820
I'm not doing this
to be a pain in your butt.

00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:05.380
You are a big pain in my butt.

00:20:05.840 --> 00:20:06.560
Mr. Godai!

00:20:06.740 --> 00:20:10.180
Listen, Yagami.
What you need is self-respect.

00:20:10.570 --> 00:20:12.230
Oh, puh-leeze.

00:20:12.400 --> 00:20:14.000
What an old line.

00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:15.340
Oh, no!

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:16.950
Oops! The teacher!

00:20:17.050 --> 00:20:18.070
Wait!

00:20:20.020 --> 00:20:22.100
Come and visit again.

00:20:22.210 --> 00:20:23.400
Sure.

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:27.340
Graduates rarely
come back to visit.

00:20:28.180 --> 00:20:32.200
Oh? Are my students still here?

00:20:32.350 --> 00:20:33.440
Excuse me.

00:20:38.360 --> 00:20:39.850
Cut it out!!

00:20:39.930 --> 00:20:41.030
Godai?

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:56.900
Am I...that unattractive?

00:20:57.210 --> 00:20:59.400
I-It's not that.

00:20:59.590 --> 00:21:02.410
Then why are you avoiding me?

00:21:03.620 --> 00:21:05.750
I'm in love with someone!

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:08.850
It's that boarding house widow,
isn't it?!

00:21:11.800 --> 00:21:13.620
Am I right, Mr. Godai?!

00:21:13.930 --> 00:21:15.730
It's none of your b--

00:21:16.360 --> 00:21:17.410
Tell me the truth!

00:21:20.580 --> 00:21:22.400
I'm leaving.

00:21:22.600 --> 00:21:25.010
Wait! I'm not done talk--

00:21:25.320 --> 00:21:26.540
Let go!

00:21:26.710 --> 00:21:27.930
--NO!
--Hey!

00:21:50.510 --> 00:21:52.620
How long are you going
to let them go?

00:21:53.100 --> 00:21:55.010
Oops. I better--

00:21:55.550 --> 00:21:56.510
Mr. Godai.

00:21:56.900 --> 00:21:58.070
Yagami.

00:21:59.910 --> 00:22:01.250
Stop right there.

00:22:02.140 --> 00:22:03.540
Ms. Kamiogi!

00:22:04.210 --> 00:22:06.840
I-It's not what you think.

00:22:07.650 --> 00:22:09.750
M-Manager.

00:22:26.740 --> 00:22:29.260
I'm glad you weren't accused as a rapist.

00:22:29.350 --> 00:22:30.430
Well, I'm NOT.

00:22:42.060 --> 00:22:46.610
Boy, am I glad I exercised self-control.

00:22:46.950 --> 00:22:48.820
--Godai?
--Yes?

00:22:48.960 --> 00:22:50.350
Are you hungry?

00:22:51.800 --> 00:22:53.650
A-Actually, I am.

00:22:54.930 --> 00:22:56.650
Why don't we grab something
to eat on our way home?

00:22:56.740 --> 00:22:57.570
Sure.

00:22:57.630 --> 00:23:00.390
--It'll be my treat today.
--Oh, please. Allow me.

00:23:00.480 --> 00:23:02.370
--Let me.
--No.

00:23:02.440 --> 00:23:04.500
I insist.

00:23:04.580 --> 00:23:07.480
--But...
--I'd really like to.

00:23:07.750 --> 00:23:09.340
Well then, thank you.

00:23:10.020 --> 00:23:11.070
Listen, young ladies.

00:23:11.140 --> 00:23:13.080
You may just be
kidding around,

00:23:13.150 --> 00:23:16.440
but men can suddenly decide
to take advantage of you.

00:23:16.560 --> 00:23:21.350
Please act like good high-school
students and behave yourselves.

00:23:21.420 --> 00:23:22.980
Especially you, Yagami.

00:23:23.300 --> 00:23:25.560
Yes. I'm deeply sorry.

00:23:26.040 --> 00:23:29.620
Good. After all, you're
the class president.

00:23:29.700 --> 00:23:34.840
You should be setting
an example for the rest of--

00:23:34.900 --> 00:23:37.860
Right! Like this
is gonna stop me!

00:23:45.990 --> 00:23:48.120
What?! You're going
